Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:07:35 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp): expose undoable model deletion

Add delete_model with named dependency refusals and one undo step.
Pin the MCP contract and document the tool.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2444
